Package: mit-token-signing
Architecture: any
Depends: pcscd, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: opensc-pkcs11
Description: M.I.T. Consulting Token signing native messaging host
 Native messaging host for the M.I.T. Consulting Token signing extension
 in Chrome, Chromium and Edge. Signs with certificates on smart cards and
 tokens through PKCS#11 modules (eObcanka, I.CA, SafeNet eToken, OpenSC).
